{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53128","headline":"云门山 · 秦系","name":"云门山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年游罢古招提，路入云门峻似梯。\n秀气渐分秦望岭，寒身犹入若耶溪。\n天开霁色澄千里，稻熟秋香互万畦。\n多少灵踪待穷览，却愁回驭日平西。\n（见《古今图书集成·山川典》卷一一四《云门山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}